title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file-manager:reveal
catalog: GUI command
target: file-manager:reveal
summary: Open the selected metarecord's folder in the file manager (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shipped ``commands.js``

!! Default keys

* ``b g m`` → ``file-manager:reveal other``
* ``g m`` → ``file-manager:reveal here``
* ``i g m`` → ``file-manager:reveal here``
* ``n g m`` → ``file-manager:reveal new``
